# SHA-256 of the committed tor.xcframework Tor binaries AND its Info.plists
# (binaries and Info.plists both covered).
# Regenerated by build-tor-xcframework.sh on rebuild; verified by
# scripts/verify-tor-xcframework.sh (pre-push). Update ONLY via a real rebuild.
#
# The root Info.plist is the SLICE-SELECTION MANIFEST — its `LibraryIdentifier`
# entries are what Xcode follows to decide which Tor.framework to link — so an
# unpinned one let an attacker add a slice and repoint the build at it with every
# recorded binary hash still matching. The per-slice Info.plists carry the
# framework identity (name, minimum OS, platform). The verifier additionally
# ENUMERATES the tree, so a file listed in no record at all is a failure.
